{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00738","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享懿德太子庙乐章 迎神 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享懿德太子庙乐章 迎神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲观昭祥，画堂升位。\n礼绝羣后，望尊储贰。\n啓诵慙德，庄丕掩粹。\n伊浦凤翔，缑峰鹤至。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}